' Extracts a date and time value in Microsoft MS-DOS format from a VARIANT.
' =====================================================================================
FUNCTION DVARIANT.ToDosDateTime (BYVAL pwDate AS USHORT PTR, BYVAL pwTime AS USHORT PTR) AS HRESULT
